      "text": "```\n  THE SCIENTIFIC VISIONARIES: WHAT MAKES THEM VISIONARY\n  ========================================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "03-SCIENTIFIC-VISIONARIES.md#003",
      "path": [
        "03-SCIENTIFIC-VISIONARIES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:visionaries:03-scientific-visionaries, git-history:visionaries:03-scientific-visionaries]",
        "canonical_path": "visionaries/03-SCIENTIFIC-VISIONARIES.md",
