        "section": "visionaries",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Scientific Visionaries: Leonardo, Darwin, Faraday, Tesla",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THE PATTERN:\n  Each saw a unified framework where others saw disconnected facts.\n  Leonardo: mechanisms are universal\n  Darwin: life is unified through common descent\n  Faraday: electromagnetism is one thing\n  Tesla: electrical power is a coherent system with AC at its core\n```"
    }
